WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
A length is only a reading, so the area has a lowest and highest too.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:10.226
A room 3.5 metres by 2.5, each to the nearest tenth.

3
00:00:11.231 --> 00:00:14.581
Each length could be five centimetres smaller or bigger.

4
00:00:15.558 --> 00:00:19.183
So the area has a lowest and a highest possible value.
